# T085 (story 6, FR-030): an update of app-02 was cut by a lost power; the first page is the repair page, and Repair finishes or undoes it.
# scenario repair
# expect-no-file system/pbstore/journal/current/10-intent.json
size 1404 1872
wait 400
waitfor repairText
expect repairText interrupted
expect repairText app-02
shot @OUT@/10-repair-page.png
tap repair
waitfor resultText
expect resultText interrupted
shot @OUT@/11-repair-result.png
tap ok
waitfor appRow
# the actions are back: the first app has one again
tap appRow 0
waitfor detailState
tap back
quit
